{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52454","headline":"回波乐 九十七 · 王梵志","name":"回波乐 九十七","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"世间何物重？\n夫妻取（项、蒋校「最」）是好。\n一个厥磨（张改作「摩」）师，眼看绝行道。\n𢣤𢣤（张改作「熏熏」）莫恨天，业是前身\n妻儿嫁与鬼，你向谁边告。\n教你别取妻，不须苦烦恼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52454.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52454","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}